      "created_at": "2013-04-25T02:51:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Having all 3&nbsp;different platings out, would reduce all 11 types of damage by 2. This Defensive Blast would do 11 instances of damage as it would (without buffs) be 1 melee, 1 projectile, 1 toxic, 1 fire, 1 energy, 1 cold, 1 lightning, 1 sonic, 1 psychic, 1 infernal, and 1 radiant damage to all target.</p>",
