      "created_at": "2013-04-25T16:33:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was about to say that I'd treat Spite's drugs differently, but then I thought about how that interaction would take place. &nbsp;Tempest would hit Spite so hard that one of the drugs in his system wouldn't have any effect? &nbsp;Even though this is fairly funny to think about I don't think it would work. &nbsp;Yeah, I'm going to start treating Spite's drugs the same way I treat everything with fixed point.</p>",
